title: 'coretime-westend, people-westend: deny XCM transfers to the `NonTransfer` proxy'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `NonTransfer` on Coretime Westend and People Westend did not deny `PolkadotXcm`, so a
    `NonTransfer` proxy could move the delegator's funds to another chain with
    `transfer_assets`/`teleport_assets`, or with `execute` as raw XCM. Both now deny
    `PolkadotXcm`, as Asset Hub Westend has done since #12771.
crates:
- name: coretime-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: people-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
